      "sourceTextSha256": "071ab53851844c675c9926fcf6de67d4169a245593b38207eed119bd091d39c4",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Private transfer with driver to the airport for your flight to Calafate. On arrival in El Calafate, a private driver will take you to your hotel. You’ll stay in El Calafate for two nights. The flight is charged separately.",
