      "sourceTextSha256": "87843a1a681917a1a39ed8df694aa055729f6e9146667babcfd689b13f6a52ae",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Group excursion to the Perito Moreno Glacier with an English-speaking guide. Private excursions with an English-speaking guide in El Calafate and Ushuaia are available for a combined supplement of $700 per person, with a minimum of two participants.",
